{"file": "D:\\SpaceBook\\_cls7_jpg\\comp\\048.jpg", "lines": [{"text": "awaz e inqilab.com", "conf": 0.882, "box": [[303, 9], [622, 9], [622, 42], [303, 42]]}, {"text": "How.to inserta soundfileinto a PowerPointpresentation?", "conf": 0.892, "box": [[58, 63], [662, 63], [662, 83], [58, 83]]}, {"text": "Adding sound to a Microsoft PowerPoint presentation can be useful in making a", "conf": 0.928, "box": [[56, 96], [863, 97], [863, 123], [56, 122]]}, {"text": "presentation more interesting and engaging. PowerPoint supports all common types", "conf": 0.927, "box": [[56, 127], [864, 125], [864, 152], [56, 154]]}, {"text": "of sound files including MP3 (MPEG-1 Audio Layer III), WAV (Waveform Audio File", "conf": 0.912, "box": [[58, 156], [862, 155], [862, 179], [58, 180]]}, {"text": "Format), FLAC (Free Lossless Audio Codec), MIDI (Musical Instrument Digital", "conf": 0.915, "box": [[58, 184], [861, 183], [861, 209], [58, 210]]}, {"text": "Interface) and WMA (Windows Media Audio). To inserta sound file into a PowerPoint", "conf": 0.908, "box": [[58, 212], [863, 211], [863, 238], [58, 239]]}, {"text": "slide,followthestepsbelow:", "conf": 0.927, "box": [[59, 243], [336, 244], [336, 267], [59, 266]]}, {"text": "1.Opena PowerPointpresentation.", "conf": 0.931, "box": [[87, 271], [428, 273], [427, 296], [87, 294]]}, {"text": "2. ClickontheInserttab.", "conf": 0.902, "box": [[90, 299], [325, 301], [325, 325], [90, 323]]}, {"text": "3.IntheMedia'sectiononthe Ribbonbar,clicktheAudioicon.", "conf": 0.906, "box": [[90, 330], [664, 329], [664, 353], [90, 354]]}, {"text": "File", "conf": 0.656, "box": [[118, 382], [155, 385], [153, 408], [116, 405]]}, {"text": "insert", "conf": 0.708, "box": [[299, 387], [355, 387], [355, 405], [299, 405]]}, {"text": "Home", "conf": 0.785, "box": [[209, 388], [263, 388], [263, 407], [209, 407]]}, {"text": "raw", "conf": 0.623, "box": [[400, 392], [430, 392], [430, 403], [400, 403]]}, {"text": "Design", "conf": 0.818, "box": [[467, 385], [531, 389],